cff-version: 1.2.0
message: If you use Req2Inst in your work, please cite the preferred citation below.
title: Req2Inst
type: software
abstract: >-
  Req2Inst transforms multimodal software requirements into standardized
  crowdsourcing task instructions using modality-aware preprocessing,
  Qwen3-8B, specialized LoRA experts, and adaptive expert routing.
keywords:
  - software requirements
  - crowdsourcing
  - multimodal data
  - task instruction generation
  - large language models
authors:
